<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/7/eng@/~cl_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after paragraph (a) the following paragraph: “ (aa) an organization established and maintained exclusively to administer and augment a public or private fund established or held for the sole purpose of carrying out the objective in which the institution is operated or conducted;” and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/7/eng@> .
